  "intro": "Which Animal Are You? is a 10-question spirit animal quiz that scores your answers across ten animals — Wolf, Fox, Owl, Cat, Dolphin, Tiger, Elephant, Octopus, Raven and Panda — and names the highest scorer as your match. Questions cover how you spend a weekend, how you handle conflict and what you do under pressure, with each option feeding points to several animals at once. Every result carries four strengths, three weaknesses, three facts about the real animal and three other animals it pairs well with.",
